SUMMARY:The Botanical Series: The Reserve
DESCRIPTION:The Botanical Series: The Reserve\nThursday\, October 8\, 2026 from 6 to 8 p.m.\nBlue Ridge Court at The North Carolina Arboretum\n\n\n\n\nAn elevated evening. A distinct Arboretum experience.\n  \nThe North Carolina Arboretum and Chemist Spirits have come together to create a one-of-a-kind botanical vodka inspired by the plants and landscapes of Western North Carolina. Developed through months of collaboration\, the spirit features botanicals thoughtfully harvested from the Arboretum and transformed by Chemist Spirits into a distinctive expression of place. \nThe Reserve offers an intimate opportunity to experience that collaboration at its most refined. Set against the mountain backdrop of Blue Ridge Court\, this limited-capacity evening pairs botanical spirits\, food and live music with a curated tasting experience led by Chemist Spirits. \nExplore the flavors and botanicals behind the spirit before creating your own botanical-infused cocktail\, guided by the experts who developed it. Then settle in and enjoy the evening with live music and heavy hors d’oeuvres in one of the Arboretum’s most beautiful settings. \nEach guest will also receive a commemorative 40th Anniversary Arboretum tasting glass to take home. Parking is included. \nPlease note: This event is for guests ages 21 and older. A valid photo ID will be required for age verification upon arrival. \nLearn more and purchase tickets here.
URL:https://ncarboretum.org/event/the-botanical-series-the-reserve/
LOCATION:Arboretum Gardens
CATEGORIES:Events
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/jpeg:https://ncarboretum.org/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/BlueRidgeCourt.jpg
END:VEVENT
